    {
      "id": "claim_f0080f6f92f148edb23ac046289bdc80",
      "statement": "In 2Q26 CCB reported net income of $3.21B (up 6.6% YoY, 1.9% QoQ) on revenue of $10.52B (up 4.3% YoY), with period-end Card loans of $145.6B (up 8.9% YoY) and card sales volume of $412.3B; Card Services & Auto revenue grew 11% YoY while Banking & Wealth Management revenue fell 2% on deposit margin compression.",
