      "id": "claim_5476d41f4bc242cda6e6d0ddab22c893",
      "statement": "CCB consumer credit decisions run through the Credit Decisioning API (API-09), which combines bureau data, behavior scores and Fraud Risk Signals API (API-08) signals; expected lifetime losses on new Card balances are reserved via the CECL model (MDL-CR-007), which takes PD/LGD from the Credit Risk Scoring API (API-10), balances from API-11 and scenarios from API-14.",
